# Check out text files with LF on every platform, to match `end_of_line = lf`
# in .editorconfig. Without this, Git for Windows (core.autocrlf=true, also the
# default on GitHub's Windows runners) checks out CRLF and the Format check
# job reports every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.esriAddinX binary
